This project is a fork of "Stop Slop Drop Top" by Tom Kristian Abel.
Original work Copyright (C) 2025 Tom Kristian Abel.

The original project is also licensed under AGPL-3.0.
Modifications made in this fork:
- Rebranded to HermesSpeaks
- Optimized for <500MB RAM (reduced from 1-2GB)
- Replaced browser automation with local ONNX inference
- Made slop removal the primary feature (detection secondary)
- Added GitHub Actions CI/CD
- Restructured CLI for easier integration

All modifications are released under AGPL-3.0.
